{
  "appliesTo": {
    "businessTypes": [
      "professional-creative"
    ],
    "entity": "all"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Read "
        },
        {
          "label": "01-core/",
          "section": "core",
          "t": "docref"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " first. This file adds the rules that apply when you sell your skill or your time."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "dc068fcce107dd2d",
      "id": "intro.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This covers consultants, designers, developers, copywriters, photographers, videographers, tutors, bookkeepers, virtual assistants, translators, and marketers."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "18dcadbfd8593c9c",
      "id": "intro.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Words used in this file"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "f8f7e4fc9c5c8540",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Words used in this file"
    },
    {
      "hash": "ace9a9c3c0b31a28",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.1",
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Plain meanings for the terms used in this file. The full list is in "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Glossary"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "lookup/glossary",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A simple tax on sales. Many professionals are not allowed to use it."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Turnover tax"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Claiming a share of your home costs because you work from a dedicated room."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Home office deduction"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Intellectual property. Who owns the work you create."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "IP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "SARS's term for someone who looks like an employee of one client. Loses most deductions."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Personal service provider"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "How many times a client may ask for changes before paying extra."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Revision rounds"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "kind": "terms"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.2",
      "kind": "hr"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This is the lightest-regulation business type in South Africa. You can usually invoice tomorrow."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "946b4a4cc397bfc3",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "What you need"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "58821a0791c46f92",
      "id": "what-you-need",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "What you need"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Almost certainly nothing beyond the core files. No municipal licence, no health inspection, no product regulation."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6861e900c266d8ce",
      "id": "what-you-need.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Two exceptions."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "e6f90228500037f9",
      "id": "what-you-need.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Some professions are statutorily regulated and may not be practised without registration: accountants signing off certain work, auditors, financial advisors under FAIS, estate agents, engineers signing designs, architects, attorneys, and health professionals. If you hold a professional title, check your body's rules on practising independently."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "18eeb08305088974",
      "id": "what-you-need.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you give financial advice or sell financial products, you need an FSP licence under FAIS or you must be a representative of a licensed FSP. Calling it \"coaching\" does not change the legal position."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "4a7e219c5ba27492",
      "id": "what-you-need.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The turnover tax trap"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "d8806676b58f30c1",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "The turnover tax trap"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This is the most important tax point for this group, and it is easy to miss."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "069990814347006f",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Turnover tax looks attractive: 0% on the first R600,000 of turnover. But most of this group cannot use it."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f283a91bcc010027",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Certain businesses are excluded, such as professional service providers, labour brokers, personal service providers, and businesses carrying on other excluded activities."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "bf0d83b8fae7a6b6",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A business is excluded where more than 20% of income comes from professional services."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "c1953ea13d408ad2",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The exclusion catches accountants, lawyers, engineers, architects, consultants and similar. Whether a designer, developer, or copywriter falls inside the exclusion is not always obvious."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "0cf9441f0ac8ccd9",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Check the SARS list for your exact trade before you elect turnover tax. Electing it wrongly and having SARS reverse it later is expensive."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "9f810942ecd81a44",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap.6",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you cannot use turnover tax, your levers are the ones in "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Tax and SARS"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "core/tax-and-sars",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ": claim every real expense, stay below the threshold while you are small, and consider the home office deduction if you qualify."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "bca721c097d05024",
      "id": "the-turnover-tax-trap.7",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The home office deduction"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "bb53ceeeeca3c461",
      "id": "the-home-office-deduction",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "The home office deduction"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This group qualifies more often than others, because the work genuinely happens at home."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "8102da3e038f7380",
      "id": "the-home-office-deduction.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "SARS generally expects a specific part of the home used regularly and exclusively for the trade, and properly equipped for it. A dedicated room qualifies. The kitchen table does not."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "dca480df2fc29c6e",
      "id": "the-home-office-deduction.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you qualify, you can claim a share of rent or bond interest, rates, and electricity based on floor area. Measure the room, measure the house, keep a photo and the calculation on file."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "bf7d42e1c78b430a",
      "id": "the-home-office-deduction.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Contracts matter more here than anywhere else"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "bd0231aaca44057c",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Contracts matter more here than anywhere else"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Your risk is not a faulty product. It is scope creep and non-payment."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6f4fe4fca091c29f",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Use the service agreement prompt in "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Which template to use when"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "paperwork/which-template-to-use-when",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". Make sure it covers:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "a9e3b1d794349d8f",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "What is included, in specific deliverables, not vague descriptions."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "ca18238e1cb31ace",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "How many rounds of revision are included, and what an extra round costs. \"Two rounds of revisions included\" is the single most valuable line in a creative contract."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6d010fd67486c816",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Who owns the work when it is finished, and when ownership transfers. Standard practice: ownership transfers on full payment, not on delivery. This is your leverage when an invoice goes unpaid."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "b7affaabc689a378",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "What happens if the client cancels midway, and what you are owed for work already done."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "c7ade88bb843b1c6",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else.6",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Payment terms, and what happens when they are missed."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "40bd6f7fc0233def",
      "id": "contracts-matter-more-here-than-anywhere-else.7",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Intellectual property"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "f43680c34dec8a01",
      "id": "intellectual-property",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Intellectual property"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "By default in South African law, the person who creates a work generally owns the copyright, unless it was made by an employee in the course of employment or the contract says otherwise."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "bb44aa3ab0d703fe",
      "id": "intellectual-property.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "That means your client does not automatically own what you made for them, unless your contract transfers it. Most clients assume they do."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "fa5209c91366b92b",
      "id": "intellectual-property.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Deal with it explicitly. Either transfer ownership on full payment, or licence the work for a defined use. Say which, in writing, before you start."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "a539256bcbf184a4",
      "id": "intellectual-property.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you use AI tools to produce client work, say so in your contract, and understand that the copyright position for AI-generated material is unsettled. Do not promise a client exclusive ownership of something you cannot guarantee."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "893cf87e81c2f326",
      "id": "intellectual-property.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Getting paid"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "76aaf7e2563d04bb",
      "id": "getting-paid",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Getting paid"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Freelancers in South Africa lose more money to late payment than to low rates."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "87cd76db15507e83",
      "id": "getting-paid.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Deposit up front. 50% is normal for project work. No deposit, no start."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "87c927691a1c74b1",
      "id": "getting-paid.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Invoice on a fixed day, every month, with clear due dates. See "
        },
        {
          "doc": "paperwork/which-template-to-use-when",
          "label": "03-documents/01",
          "t": "docref"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "7461f3d3dee39db1",
      "id": "getting-paid.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "State your late payment terms in the contract, and apply them. Interest on overdue amounts is enforceable if it was agreed in advance."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "20507fa6e8b13be9",
      "id": "getting-paid.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Withhold final files until final payment. This only works if your contract says ownership transfers on payment, which is why that clause matters."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f7acb86df228dfcd",
      "id": "getting-paid.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Tax point most freelancers miss"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "edf9ab4526c4ed22",
      "id": "tax-point-most-freelancers-miss",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Tax point most freelancers miss"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you work mainly for one client, who controls your hours and how you work, SARS may treat you as a personal service provider or as an employee. That changes your tax treatment significantly and removes most of your deductions."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "8d9f9b18371a4426",
      "id": "tax-point-most-freelancers-miss.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Signs of risk: one client providing most of your income, working set hours at their premises, using their equipment, having a manager."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "7193c00ca4504ae9",
      "id": "tax-point-most-freelancers-miss.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If that describes you, get advice. It is fixable, but not after an assessment."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "67b329559cb5472a",
      "id": "tax-point-most-freelancers-miss.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Branding and marketing notes"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "cf2e2a9a2f4c9c97",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Branding and marketing notes"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Use "
        },
        {
          "label": "02-branding-and-marketing/",
          "section": "branding",
          "t": "docref"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". For this group, the priority order is different from a local trade:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "68c2f5f6509cbc8f",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "c23092a860bdd02d",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes.2",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Portfolio of actual work, even two or three pieces"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A clear description of what you do and who you do it for"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "LinkedIn, if you sell to businesses"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Referrals from past clients, asked for directly"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A simple website"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "kind": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "start": 1
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The naming prompt in "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Branding prompts"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "branding/branding-prompts",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " works, but consider trading under your own name. For a solo consultant or creative, \"Naledi Mokoena Design\" often builds more trust than an invented agency name, and it never becomes a lie when someone asks how big the team is."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "fcda45f1b3b97b7a",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
